Package: simplemarkdown
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Lightweight read-only Markdown viewer
 SimpleMarkdown is a cross-platform Markdown viewer with a custom chunked,
 virtualized rendering engine: huge files open instantly, scrolling stays
 smooth and the outline panel jumps to any heading immediately.
